---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "合作廠商"
permalink: /partners/
---
<h1>合作廠商</h1>
<p>以下為與本病房合作之廠商,如有需要可直接聯繫。</p>

{% set accents = ["primary", "tertiary", "success", "warning", "secondary"] %}

{% if partners.list.length %}
<div class="vendor-grid">
  {% for partner in partners.list %}
  {% set accent = accents[loop.index0 % accents.length] %}
  <div class="vendor-card vendor-card--{{ accent }}">
    <div class="vendor-card__accent">
      {% if partner.logo %}
      <img src="{{ partner.logo }}" alt="{{ partner.name }}標誌" class="vendor-card__logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      {% else %}
      <span class="vendor-card__icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">{{ partner.icon or "storefront" }}</span>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="vendor-card__content">
      <div class="vendor-card__heading">
        <p class="vendor-card__name">{{ partner.name }}</p>
        {% if partner.category %}<p class="vendor-card__category">{{ partner.category }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if partner.note %}<p class="vendor-card__note">{{ partner.note }}</p>{% endif %}

      {% if partner.address %}
      <p class="vendor-card__address">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">location_on</span>
        {{ partner.address }}
      </p>
      {% endif %}

      {% if partner.phone or partner.email %}
      <div class="vendor-card__actions">
        {% if partner.phone %}
        <a href="tel:{{ partner.phone }}" class="btn btn--tonal">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">call</span>
          {{ partner.phone }}
        </a>
        {% endif %}
        {% if partner.email %}
        <a href="mailto:{{ partner.email }}" class="btn btn--outlined">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">mail</span>
          {{ partner.email }}
        </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% else %}
<p>目前尚無合作廠商資料。</p>
{% endif %}
